{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15208180","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15208180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1520818001:1":{"text":"올브, 페이투, 방금은 둘 다 훌륭했다.","source_cn":"欧布，费斗，你们刚才做得很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8F7658776F5A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520818002:1":{"text":"하지만 너희들은 지금 시합 중이란 걸 잊은 것 같군.","source_cn":"但你们似乎忘了，这是一场比赛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D1C481FBCC5187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520818003:0":{"text":"아닙니다. 잊지 않았습니다!","source_cn":"不，我们没忘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E71D303AF9B70AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520818004:0":{"text":"이 사냥감들은 페이투가 잡은 것으로 쳐도, 제가 활로 잡은 늑대가 페이투가 창으로 죽인 것보다 훨씬 더 많으니까요!","source_cn":"即使把这只算作费斗的猎物，我用箭杀死的野狼也一定比他用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA06CA28E43653CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520818005:0":{"text":"믿지 못하시겠다면, 아버지께서 직접 세어보셔도 좋습니다!","source_cn":"如果阿爹你不信，就尽管去数一数！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD817DF353F401AD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520818006:1":{"text":"그렇게 뛰어난 녀석이 왜 페이투와 힘을 합친 거지?","source_cn":"要是你这么有能耐，为什么还要和费斗合作？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x522078435DDBA698","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520818007:0":{"text":"힘을 합친게 아니라 제가 도와준 것입니다!","source_cn":"不是合作，是我在帮他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5406AE1873ED9858","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520818008:0":{"text":"이 늑대는 달리기도 빠르고 몸놀림도 날렵해서, 페이투의 창으로는 역부족이었거든요.","source_cn":"这只狼跑得太快了，动作也很敏捷。费斗的矛根本刺不中它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AA9181988D53CF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520818009:1":{"text":"맞습니다. 저 혼자서 도저히 사냥할 방법이 없었습니다. 올브가 절 도와줬습니다.","source_cn":"没错，我没办法单独靠近它。是欧布帮了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x567E620B6E0FF199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1520818010:1":{"text":"그게 사실이라면 올브가 제법 잘한 셈이군. ","source_cn":"真是这样的话，欧布做的还算不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5DC2291A8980A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520818011:0":{"text":"...절 칭찬하는 법을 잊으신 건 아닌 것 같아서 다행이